{
  "bookId": "activity-extra-tu2ye_qiandao",
  "id": "source-35022",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "35022001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "葵？你在哪？\n跑到哪里去了，刚刚还在的……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35022002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "呣~~（伸懒腰），优纪找我吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35022003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "果然，葵在任何地方都能睡着。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35022004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "唔，主人也在，要一起补充睡眠吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35022005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这个是送给你的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35022006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "特别给我的？里面是——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35022007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "向日葵枕头、瓜子形状的抱枕……都是我的最爱。呣，非常感谢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35022008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不是我准备的哦，是这位「兔儿爷」的心意。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35022009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "兔儿爷",
          "text": "是喜欢睡觉的孩子吗？很安逸的爱好呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35022010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "安逸的爱好吗……第一次听到这样的说法。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35022011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "以前执行任务的时候，梅根队长和其他队友总是对我的爱好不以为然。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35022012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "现在虽然有时间睡觉，可也没有人能够理解我。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35022013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "呣~总觉得，我好像碰到了知己。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35022014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "能看到葵的睡颜，的确是一件安逸美好的事。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35022015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "作为回报，我也会为你们准备一份特别的惊喜。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35022016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "是什么是什么，可以先透露一些内幕消息吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35022017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "暂时还不行，等准备好了，自然会知道的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35022018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "唔呣，在那之前，还是得先睡个好觉，Zzzzzz。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
